Keyternity
==========

Keyternity is a modified version of SkelForm.

  SkelForm  https://github.com/Retropaint/SkelForm
            Copyright (C) Retropaint and contributors
            Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (LICENSE.md)

Keyternity was forked from SkelForm at upstream commit 68b66d21
("Merge pull request #10 from pfirmino/master", 2026-09-11; 64ba8306 in
this repository, whose history was rewritten to drop FFmpeg binaries), and
diverged from it on 2026-09-30. It is distributed under the same license, GPL-3.0.
Keyternity's modifications are copyright their authors and released under
GPL-3.0. The full history of every change is in this repository's git log.


